1
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,239
Zhou Yan and I

2
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:18,000
analyzed their chat records.

3
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:21,640
Lu Minchuan knows
Zhou Yumei's preferences very well.

4
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:23,700
He likely approached her on purpose.

5
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:25,960
What was his motive then?

6
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:27,960
For the money.

7
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:30,490
Lu Minchuan knew Zhou Yumei had money.

8
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:31,960
And judging by the result,

9
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:33,160
he achieved his goal.

10
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:35,040
Zhou Yumei did consider

11
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,480
giving him the money.

12
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,240
But people Zhou Yumei's age

13
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:41,040
rarely use QQ, right?

14
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:44,440
Because QQ doesn't require
real-name authentication.

15
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:45,320
So...

16
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:47,240
he probably did it
to get close to Zhou Yumei.

17
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:49,100
A specially created alt account.

18
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:51,320
When Zhou Yumei was young,

19
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,300
she had a crush on Lu Minchuan.

20
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:55,320
And Lu Minchuan took advantage of this

21
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:57,080
to easily gain her trust.

22
00:00:58,480 --> 00:00:59,040
Zhou Yan,

23
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:01,560
has Lu Minchuan returned to Beitan City?

24
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:02,160
He's back.

25
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:04,599
He's currently being questioned
by the police.

26
00:01:04,599 --> 00:01:05,129
Alright.

27
00:01:05,319 --> 00:01:05,600
Wei,

28
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:08,039
you and Kaixin watch
the interrogation monitor.

29
00:01:08,039 --> 00:01:10,280
Zhou Yan and I will go give
Zhou Yumei a polygraph test.

30
00:01:10,280 --> 00:01:10,610
Okay.

31
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Do you know the person in this photo?

32
00:01:14,360 --> 00:01:15,560
Looks a bit familiar.

33
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,200
Zhou something...

34
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:20,660
I can't remember clearly.

35
00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:22,500
Her name is Zhou Yumei.

36
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:25,180
You two were chatting
on the phone recently.

37
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:26,240
We never chatted.

38
00:01:26,240 --> 00:01:26,840
I...

39
00:01:28,160 --> 00:01:29,600
Zhou Yumei.

40
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:32,050
I remember a little.

41
00:01:32,080 --> 00:01:32,960
I met her

42
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:33,930
back when

43
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:35,050
I was sent to work

44
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,520
in the countryside.

45
00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:38,039
We haven't seen each other since.

46
00:01:38,039 --> 00:01:39,039
We never chatted.

47
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:40,160
Here,

48
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:41,560
we have the chat logs.

49
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:42,640
Take a look.

50
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,700
Does it ring a bell?

51
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:46,800
This is fake.

52
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:47,920
Except for

53
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:49,000
my personal info,

54
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,440
everything else is forged.

55
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:50,960
Someone

56
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:52,400
is framing me.

57
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:54,160
Then tell us

58
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:56,410
your impression of Zhou Yumei.

59
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,520
I don't have much of an impression of her.

60
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:00,920
I wouldn't even remember her

61
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:02,920
if you hadn't mentioned it.

62
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:04,730
That can't be right.

63
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:05,760
She said

64
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:07,600
she used to have a crush on you.

65
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:09,600
You two must have been pretty close.

66
00:02:10,479 --> 00:02:11,210
A crush on me?

67
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:14,130
How would I know about that?

68
00:02:14,480 --> 00:02:16,320
I only met her once.

69
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:18,320
I never contacted her again.

70
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,160
Officer,

71
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:20,280
If you don't believe me,

72
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,440
you can look into it.

73
00:02:23,079 --> 00:02:25,040
I don't think Lu Minchuan is lying.

74
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:28,520
Let's wait for the police
investigation results.

75
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:31,800
Kaixin,

76
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:34,140
come with me to Shangwang Village later.

77
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:35,240
Okay.

78
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:45,040
I'm going to ask you some questions
related to the case.

79
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:46,570
You only need to answer yes,

80
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:47,320
no,

81
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:48,850
or choose

82
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:50,000
not to answer.

83
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,240
Are you ready?

84
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,320
During your chats with Lu Minchuan,

85
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:58,520
did he explicitly ask if you had money?

86
00:02:59,000 --> 00:02:59,360
Yes.

87
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,520
Did you volunteer the information

88
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,640
that you had
a demolition compensation fund?

89
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:04,000
Yes.

90
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:07,640
Did Lu Minchuan ask you
to transfer the money directly to him?

91
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:08,720
No,

92
00:03:09,720 --> 00:03:10,480
he didn't.

93
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,840
At the time of the incident,

94
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:13,200
was there anyone else at the scene

95
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:14,800
besides you and Li Hongkang?

96
00:03:17,079 --> 00:03:17,720
No.

97
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:23,480
Did Li Hongkang accidentally hurt you

98
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:25,160
when he grabbed the knife from you?

99
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:25,440
Yes.

100
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,660
Was there blood on the knife at that time?

101
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:31,680
I...

102
00:03:33,079 --> 00:03:34,360
I can't remember clearly.

103
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:36,079
Did Li Hongkang casually put the knife

104
00:03:36,079 --> 00:03:37,210
on the dining table?

105
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,060
Yes.

106
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,400
Did you stab Li Hongkang?

107
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:41,260
Yes.

108
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:44,010
How many times did you stab him?

109
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:48,320
Twice.

110
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:50,760
Did you use the knife he cut you with?

111
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:51,420
Yes,

112
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:53,720
that's the one.

113
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:56,680
You've seen Lu Minchuan's video.

114
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:59,010
What do you think about Zhou Yumei's case?

115
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:01,160
I think it's unbelievable,

116
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:02,720
and very tragic.

117
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:05,460
Zhou Yumei had a crush on Lu Minchuan,

118
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:07,610
but he took advantage of her feelings.

119
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:09,600
By the way,

120
00:04:09,880 --> 00:04:11,680
why are we at Shangwang Village?

121
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:16,250
This is Zhou Yumei's hometown,

122
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,329
and where she met

123
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:19,440
Lu Minchuan and Li Hongkang.

124
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:22,620
After all these years,

125
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:24,200
the elders in the village

126
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,860
must remember what happened.

127
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:28,680
I've already contacted
the neighborhood committee.

128
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:30,120
We can just head straight there.

129
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:30,480
Okay.

130
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:34,200
I have to say,

131
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:36,530
the air here is fresher
than in the office.

132
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:39,520
Why isn't there anyone around?

133
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:47,880
Stop right there!

134
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,300
Move and I'll kill you!

135
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:56,920
Wei!

136
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:03,520
Wei, what's wrong?

137
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:05,730
Let's go.

138
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,100
Are you hungry?

139
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:39,480
Do you want to eat?

140
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:50,680
Eat up.

141
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:57,620
I bought you with my own money.

142
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:59,380
If you starve to death,

143
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:01,200
my money goes down the drain.

144
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:11,680
Fine.

145
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,290
That's more like it.

146
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,640
You stay with me,

147
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:26,480
okay?

148
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:27,720
We'll have a baby,

149
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,080
and the three of us

150
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:30,400
will live a good life together,

151
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:30,960
right?

152
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:33,330
Isn't that nice?

153
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:42,040
Wait here.

154
00:06:49,400 --> 00:06:49,960
Stop!

155
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,600
Can I help you?

156
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:05,520
Hello,

157
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:07,880
is the village committee this way?

158
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:22,280
Wei.

159
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:26,920
This is the village

160
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:30,720
where I was trafficked.

161
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:33,940
This is the road

162
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:37,240
I took to escape.

163
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,120
You must be starving.

164
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,720
Mom brought you some food.

165
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:15,920
It's all cold.

166
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:18,400
I didn't even notice.

167
00:08:32,760 --> 00:08:33,280
Bozhou,

168
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,840
stop drawing these pictures.

169
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:36,280
Why?

170
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:38,440
No reason.

171
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,679
Just stop drawing them.

172
00:08:39,679 --> 00:08:41,340
They make Mom uncomfortable.

173
00:08:58,360 --> 00:09:00,080
Who were those two women

174
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:01,640
who came to the shop last time?

175
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:03,170
That's grown-up business.

176
00:09:03,440 --> 00:09:04,280
You're a kid.

177
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:06,320
It has nothing to do with you.

178
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:07,120
Stay out of it.

179
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:08,880
Grandpa and Grandma are gone.

180
00:09:08,880 --> 00:09:10,410
They came looking for them,

181
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:11,000
right?

182
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:21,360
Where did Grandpa and Grandma go?

183
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,240
I miss them.

184
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:27,010
Grandpa and Grandma

185
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:30,450
just had to go on a long trip
for something.

186
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:33,520
They'll be back when you grow up.

187
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,090
Don't overthink it.

188
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,210
That's what you said

189
00:09:38,400 --> 00:09:39,640
when Dad left.

190
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:45,880
Right now,

191
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:47,120
you're a kid.

192
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:50,160
You don't need to know that much.

193
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,850
All you need to remember is that

194
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:55,010
Mom will always be with you.

195
00:09:55,640 --> 00:09:56,500
That's enough.

196
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:57,320
Don't worry,

197
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:57,880
Mom.

198
00:09:58,160 --> 00:09:59,360
I'll protect you too.

199
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:04,100
Silly child, what are you talking about?

200
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:07,370
It's Mom who should be protecting you.

201
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:11,860
Will those two women come
looking for you again?

202
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:14,880
Just leave it alone.

203
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:18,240
Just mind your own business.

204
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:19,400
Mom,

205
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:21,800
why are we living here now

206
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,140
instead of at home?

207
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:27,800
Why do you have so many questions today?

208
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:31,210
Hurry up and eat.

209
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:33,440
The food will get cold again.

210
00:10:42,800 --> 00:10:44,480
Zhou Yumei's polygraph results are out.

211
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,600
They confirmed our suspicions.

212
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:47,460
She is indeed suspected of lying,

213
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:48,400
especially regarding

214
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:50,160
the murder weapon at the crime scene.

215
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:51,440
Her physiological readings

216
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:53,280
showed significant fluctuations.

217
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:54,880
The police further verified

218
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:56,440
the account chatting with Zhou Yumei,

219
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,640
analyzing the IP address

220
00:10:57,640 --> 00:10:59,080
and frequently used login devices.

221
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,240
Finally, they confirmed

222
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,480
that the person chatting with Zhou Yumei

223
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:03,080
wasn't Lu Minchuan himself.

224
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:05,280
That matches the results of our visits.

225
00:11:05,280 --> 00:11:07,080
Someone impersonated Lu Minchuan

226
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,410
to chat with Zhou Yumei.

227
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:08,970
Exactly.

228
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:10,760
But guess

229
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:12,620
what his real identity is.

230
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:13,360
I bet

231
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:15,320
you'll never guess.

232
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:16,610
Who is it?

233
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:18,040
Take a guess.

234
00:11:21,040 --> 00:11:21,640
Who?

235
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:23,300
Are you going to tell us or not?

236
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:25,080
Stop keeping us in suspense.

237
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:25,740
Just say it.

238
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:27,760
His real identity is

239
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:29,520
Li Hongkang himself.

240
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:33,400
That's so dramatic.

241
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:34,880
You mean

242
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,200
Li Hongkang

243
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:37,960
impersonated someone else

244
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:39,490
to date his own wife online?

245
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:42,330
All the evidence the police have right now

246
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:43,620
points to Li Hongkang.

247
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,320
Li Hongkang's smashed phone

248
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:46,880
has been sent to the forensics center.

249
00:11:46,880 --> 00:11:47,360
The data

250
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:48,640
will be recovered soon.

251
00:11:48,640 --> 00:11:50,880
Li Hongkang knew Zhou Yumei had money

252
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:52,280
and knew about her past,

253
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:55,400
so he wanted to impersonate Lu Minchuan

254
00:11:55,640 --> 00:11:57,240
to get his hands on her money.

255
00:11:58,360 --> 00:12:01,240
She still doesn't know
Lu Minchuan's true identity.

256
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:04,500
still living in the beautiful lie
Li Hongkang wove for her.

257
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:05,930
She killed Li Hongkang,

258
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:06,720
but

259
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:08,650
she was also egged on by him.

260
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:10,520
I still find it unbelievable.

261
00:12:11,160 --> 00:12:12,120
To think there's someone

262
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:13,380
in this world who would

263
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:14,840
kill themselves.

264
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:16,120
It's more like...

265
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:18,120
Li Hongkang's behavior was
more like some kind of

266
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:19,480
obedience test.

267
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:22,560
It's just that Li Hongkang
really didn't expect

268
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:24,160
to die at Zhou Yumei's hands.

269
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:50,720
Hello?

270
00:12:55,560 --> 00:12:56,040
Hello?

271
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:59,800
I'm hanging up if you don't speak.

272
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:02,930
Are you the lady who came looking
for my mom the other day?

273
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,000
Are you Li Bozhou?

274
00:13:11,680 --> 00:13:13,200
Are you alone right now?

275
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:15,880
I'm scared.

276
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:17,780
Why are you scared?

277
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:19,540
When I went home that day, I saw

278
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:21,130
Grandpa bullying Grandma.

279
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:22,880
My mom is not a bad person.

280
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:24,400
Please don't arrest her.

281
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:26,120
You mean

282
00:13:26,560 --> 00:13:28,090
you were there that day too?

283
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:30,360
What about your mom?

284
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:31,360
Was she there too?

285
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:50,000
Li Bozhou said

286
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,840
he saw his grandfather
abusing his grandmother.

287
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:54,300
Doesn't that mean
Xu Nianqiu was also there?

288
00:13:54,800 --> 00:13:56,440
They returned to the compound together.

289
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,500
If Li Bozhou saw it,

290
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:59,560
Xu Nianqiu must have been there too.

291
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:01,480
But can an eight-year-old's words

292
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:02,680
be used as testimony?

293
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,680
According to the Criminal Procedure Law,

294
00:14:04,680 --> 00:14:07,120
an eight-year-old's testimony
has limited probative value.

295
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:09,720
It needs to be corroborated
by other evidence.

296
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:18,060
Come in.

297
00:14:19,640 --> 00:14:21,000
Li Hongkang's phone data

298
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:22,440
has been fully recovered.

299
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:25,400
Can you check the operation logs
from before the phone broke?

300
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:25,960
Yes, we can.

301
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:27,360
We did a mirror recovery,

302
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:30,280
so we can see
the phone's complete operation logs.

303
00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:32,080
Here is the phone's usage history

304
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:33,340
on the day of the crime.

305
00:14:33,400 --> 00:14:34,060
Take a look.

306
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:35,480
Around 4:00 PM,

307
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:36,380
Li Hongkang

308
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:38,200
was using a video player app.

309
00:14:39,680 --> 00:14:43,760
Li Hongkang unlocked his phone at 4:14 PM

310
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:45,520
and looked at it for nine minutes.

311
00:14:45,520 --> 00:14:46,160
Then at

312
00:14:46,520 --> 00:14:49,040
4:23 PM,

313
00:14:49,040 --> 00:14:50,300
the phone was smashed.

314
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:52,000
So during this interval,

315
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:54,400
his argument with Zhou Yumei
either started

316
00:14:54,400 --> 00:14:55,730
or was already ongoing.

317
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:59,800
Xu Nianqiu entered the compound at 4:24.

318
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:00,920
We tested it before,

319
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:02,320
and it takes three minutes
to get to the apartment.

320
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:04,880
That means she arrived at 4:27.

321
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:07,020
It's highly likely

322
00:15:07,640 --> 00:15:09,770
that Xu Nianqiu was at the crime scene.

323
00:15:10,560 --> 00:15:13,520
That perfectly corroborates
what Li Bozhou said last night.

324
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:15,520
It means Zhou Yumei lied in her confession

325
00:15:15,520 --> 00:15:18,360
to cover up the fact
that Xu Nianqiu was at the scene.

326
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:20,400
She most likely saw their dispute

327
00:15:20,680 --> 00:15:22,940
and even witnessed Li Hongkang's death.

328
00:15:23,280 --> 00:15:24,680
Let's make a bold guess.

329
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:26,760
Was she also involved in it?

330
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:36,120
Li Hongkang's behavioral logic
doesn't make sense.

331
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,320
After slashing Zhou Yumei,

332
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:39,720
why would he just put the knife
on the table?

333
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:43,520
According to the phone records,

334
00:15:43,520 --> 00:15:46,360
Li Hongkang smashed his phone at 4:23 PM

335
00:15:46,560 --> 00:15:48,360
and started arguing with Zhou Yumei.

336
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:49,840
According to the surveillance footage,

337
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:52,320
Xu Nianqiu and Li Bozhou

338
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,560
returned to the neighborhood at 4:24 p.m.

339
00:15:53,560 --> 00:15:54,040
So

340
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:56,800
it's highly likely that Xu Nianqiu
witnessed the entire crime.

341
00:15:56,800 --> 00:15:58,730
Based on the clues the police have,

342
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,160
Zhou Yumei gave a debit card
with 300,000 yuan

343
00:16:00,160 --> 00:16:02,420
to Xu Nianqiu before calling the police.

344
00:16:02,800 --> 00:16:03,600
Her excuse was

345
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:05,720
that the money was for her grandson.

346
00:16:05,760 --> 00:16:07,160
Then can I suspect

347
00:16:07,160 --> 00:16:09,560
that Xu Nianqiu was also
involved in this case,

348
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:11,620
and her motive was also for the money?

349
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:13,480
But right now, apart from the timeline,

350
00:16:13,480 --> 00:16:14,880
there's no other evidence to prove

351
00:16:14,880 --> 00:16:16,520
what Xu Nianqiu saw

352
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:17,780
or did at that time.

353
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:20,600
Kaixin.

354
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:22,360
Come with me
to the detention center later.

355
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:22,690
Okay.

356
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:25,180
We've restored Li Hongkang's phone.

357
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,840
He smashed it

358
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:28,400
at 4:23 p.m.

359
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:29,320
Which means

360
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:30,600
you had an argument

361
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:31,600
before that.

362
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:34,600
The gate's surveillance camera shows

363
00:16:34,600 --> 00:16:36,440
Xu Nianqiu entering the neighborhood

364
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:37,840
at 4:24 p.m.

365
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:39,040
We ran a test.

366
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:41,360
It takes her about three minutes
to get home.

367
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:43,560
Making it around 4:27 p.m.

368
00:16:43,800 --> 00:16:46,480
And she left the neighborhood at 4:30 p.m.

369
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:47,440
So

370
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:49,840
Xu Nianqiu was at the crime scene.

371
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:51,600
Why did you hide this?

372
00:16:51,960 --> 00:16:54,490
And why did you wait so long
to call the police?

373
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:56,960
I don't know what you're talking about.

374
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:58,080
I killed him.

375
00:16:58,680 --> 00:17:00,080
I've already confessed.

376
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:04,800
I'm guessing you deliberately
delayed calling the police

377
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:06,240
to cover for Xu Nianqiu

378
00:17:06,720 --> 00:17:08,319
and give her an alibi,

379
00:17:08,520 --> 00:17:08,920
right?

380
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:09,520
No.

381
00:17:09,839 --> 00:17:10,569
I don't know.

382
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:11,200
No.

383
00:17:11,599 --> 00:17:12,480
I don't know.

384
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:14,440
What about the murder weapon?

385
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:16,040
You said that knife cut you.

386
00:17:16,040 --> 00:17:18,880
But your blood sample wasn't detected
on the weapon at the scene.

387
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:21,000
Was there another knife
at the crime scene?

388
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:22,359
I don't know what you're talking about.

389
00:17:22,359 --> 00:17:23,599
I really don't know

390
00:17:23,599 --> 00:17:24,680
anything.

391
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:44,680
Wei,

392
00:17:45,040 --> 00:17:46,640
what did Zhou Yumei say?

393
00:17:47,520 --> 00:17:49,000
She still refuses to confess

394
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:51,440
and insists on taking all the blame.

395
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:53,080
Her grandson is

396
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:54,410
all she cares about now.

397
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:57,000
To ensure Xu Nianqiu
takes good care of him,

398
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:59,260
she will definitely keep her mouth shut.

399
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:02,570
Let's share the current leads
with the police first.

400
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:03,520
Don't forget,

401
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:05,900
Xu Nianqiu is also a breakthrough point.

402
00:18:14,120 --> 00:18:16,400
Isn't that Xu Nianqiu and her child?

403
00:18:25,080 --> 00:18:25,680
Kaixin,

404
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:27,000
you and Zhou Yan watch the kid.

405
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:29,730
Remember to put away the files
and the clue board.

406
00:18:30,280 --> 00:18:30,760
Wei,

407
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:31,530
let's go.

408
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:34,440
Bozhou,

409
00:18:35,160 --> 00:18:36,160
Look what this is.

410
00:18:36,280 --> 00:18:38,010
An orange-flavored lollipop.

411
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:40,080
It was my favorite when I was little.

412
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:41,600
I'll give it to you, okay?

413
00:18:43,040 --> 00:18:45,640
Mom said I shouldn't take food
from strangers.

414
00:18:49,040 --> 00:18:50,120
Your mom is right.

415
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:52,360
But we are just like the police.

416
00:18:52,360 --> 00:18:53,680
We catch bad guys.

417
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:05,000
Wanna play?

418
00:19:11,360 --> 00:19:12,360
You wanna play, don't you?
